msgid "10. 熱伝導の計算"
msgstr "10\\. Heat Conduction Calculation"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "ここまでに学んだ配列、`for_each`・`reduce`、MPI、GPU を、1 次元の熱伝導の計算に組み合わせます。 この章では、方程式を差分で解く手順と、結果が正しいかを確かめる方法を説明します。 プログラムは {ref}`実習 heat1d <edu-practice-heat1d>` の仕様に沿って、自分で書きます。"
msgstr "In this chapter, you combine the arrays, `for_each` and `reduce`, MPI, and GPUs you have learned so far into a 1D heat conduction calculation. The chapter explains how to solve the equation with finite differences and how to check that the result is correct. You write the program yourself, following the specification of the {ref}`Practice heat1d <edu-practice-heat1d>`."

msgid "作る順番は次の 3 段階です。"
msgstr "You build the program in the following three stages."

msgid "逐次版：1 プロセスの CPU で、`Array1D` と `backend::Host` の `for_each`・`reduce` を使って解きます。"
msgstr "Serial version: solve the problem on the CPU in a single process, using `Array1D` and the `for_each` and `reduce` of `backend::Host`."

msgid "MPI 版：領域を分け、隣のランクとゴーストセルの値を `MPI_Sendrecv` で交換します。"
msgstr "MPI version: divide the domain and exchange ghost cell values with the neighboring ranks using `MPI_Sendrecv`."

msgid "GPU 版：配列を `Array1D<Real, backend::CUDA>` に、ループを `backend::CUDA` の `for_each` に置き換えます。"
msgstr "GPU version: replace the arrays with `Array1D<Real, backend::CUDA>` and the loops with the `for_each` of `backend::CUDA`."

msgid "1 と 2 は Ubuntu・Mac の CPU だけで完了できます。3 も、GPU がなければ同じソースを CPU 用にビルドして、構成が正しいことまで確かめられます。"
msgstr "Stages 1 and 2 can be completed on the CPU of an Ubuntu or Mac machine. For stage 3, if you have no GPU, you can build the same source for the CPU and still check that the structure is correct."

